    "source_message_id": 56,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Hi Marissa,\n\nNice pictures! I have a couple of website items to review with you.\n\nFirst, I’d like to add informational, non-marketing pages, including the Sign In page and an Account Provisioning wizard. Those pages need only a background and header logo, with perhaps the footer outlined below. To style the AWS Cognito authentication pages, I quickly created one using your landing-page background.\n\nFor the footer, I’d like more content and the following menu links. I think a solid background in the SignalCadence brand color could look good.\n\nLH block:\nLumenArc Intelligence (or logo)\nHarbor Glen\nOregon, USA\nhello@lumenarc-demo.example\n(202) 555-0146\n\nRH block (links):\nHome\nContact Us\nSupport\nCookie Notice\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nLegal\n\nBottom center:\nSocial icons - LinkedIn, X (for now)\nCopyright (c) 2032 LumenArc Systems LLC. All rights reserved\n\nBest,\nDerek"
  },
